rove it. GOOD: \\`recommend-level.sh --quiet --loc 500 --files 15\\` prints one line and exits 0. WEAK: The feature is successful. -->\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:1256:<!-- FILL: Write one measurable outcome per line. A command can prove it. GOOD: \\`recommend-level.sh --quiet --loc 500 --files 15\\` prints one line and exits 0. WEAK: The feature is successful. -->\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:2039:<!-- FILL: Write one measurable outcome per line. A command can prove it. GOOD: \\`recommend-level.sh --quiet --loc 500 --files 15\\` prints one line and exits 0. WEAK: The feature is successful. -->\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:3017:<!-- FILL: Write one measurable outcome per line. A command can prove it. GOOD: \\`recommend-level.sh --quiet --loc 500 --files 15\\` prints one line and exits 0. WEAK: The feature is successful. -->\n\n=== tests referencing the script ===\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/test-phase-system.js\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/test-phase-validation.js\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/223-deepseek-final","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"443e74","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
